{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇねぇ、聞いて？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあたしの自慢。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで20年間生きて来たけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は『虫歯が一本もないんだ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これって素晴らしいことじゃない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか、こんなに甘い物を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20年間で考えると絶対1億は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口にしてると思うのに何でかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"虫歯菌があたしの口には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いらっしゃらないの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歯医者さんに行くと良く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"褒められるの٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗に磨いてますね〜って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと神様があたしの目の視力を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんま良くしなかったかわりに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可哀想だからって口のなかだけは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗にしてくれたんだね٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/11/21/0348385/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょこっと前歯ちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/11/21/0348385/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全開前歯ちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image"